  nodes:
  - DialogueId: AMARA_INTRO
    Speaker: Queen Amara
    Text: Ishan. Good. I have had the same dream four nights running, and I am told that is not a thing queens are permitted to mention aloud.
    RequiredFlags: []
    BlockingFlags:
    - QUEENS_CHARGE_GIVEN
    RequiredMemoryId: 
    RequiredMemoryState: 
    Consequences:
    - Type: 0
      Target: MET_AMARA
      Amount: 0
    Choices: []
    NextDialogueId: AMARA_INTRO_2
    Subtitle: 
    VoiceAssetId: 
  - DialogueId: AMARA_INTRO_2
    Speaker: Queen Amara
    Text: In it, there are eight thrones on the ruin stone past the temple district. Our histories record seven gods. I would like you to go and count them for me.
    RequiredFlags: []
    BlockingFlags: []
    RequiredMemoryId: 
    RequiredMemoryState: 
    Consequences: []
    Choices:
    - Text: I'll go now.
      NextDialogueId: AMARA_ACCEPT
      RequiredFlags: []
      BlockingFlags: []
      Consequences:
      - Type: 5
        Target: AMARA
        Amount: 1
    - Text: Eight? The histories are not wrong about the gods.
      NextDialogueId: AMARA_DOUBT
      RequiredFlags: []
      BlockingFlags: []
      Consequences: []
    NextDialogueId: 
    Subtitle: 
    VoiceAssetId: 
  - DialogueId: AMARA_DOUBT
    Speaker: Queen Amara
    Text: No. They are not wrong. That is exactly what troubles me. A wrong history can be corrected. A history that is complete and still short one seat is something else.
    RequiredFlags: []
    BlockingFlags: []
    RequiredMemoryId: 
    RequiredMemoryState: 
    Consequences: []
    Choices: []
    NextDialogueId: AMARA_ACCEPT
    Subtitle: 
    VoiceAssetId: 
  - DialogueId: AMARA_ACCEPT
    Speaker: Queen Amara
    Text: Go quietly. Take nothing from the stone but what it says. And Ishan - if you find you already know what is written there, come back faster.
    RequiredFlags: []
    BlockingFlags: []
    RequiredMemoryId: 
    RequiredMemoryState: 
    Consequences:
    - Type: 0
      Target: QUEENS_CHARGE_GIVEN
      Amount: 0
    - Type: 2
      Target: Q001
      Amount: 0
    Choices: []
    NextDialogueId: 
    Subtitle: 
    VoiceAssetId: 
  - DialogueId: AMARA_WAITING
    Speaker: Queen Amara
    Text: The ruins are past the temple district, where the ground stops being ours. Mira can tell you what the older carvings mean, if you can get her to stop at one sentence.
    RequiredFlags:
    - QUEENS_CHARGE_GIVEN
    BlockingFlags:
    - FIRST_MEMORY_FOUND
    RequiredMemoryId: 
    RequiredMemoryState: 
    Consequences: []
    Choices: []
    NextDialogueId: 
    Subtitle: 
    VoiceAssetId: 
  - DialogueId: AMARA_RETURN
    Speaker: Queen Amara
    Text: You counted them. I can see it on you. How many?
    RequiredFlags:
    - FIRST_MEMORY_FOUND
    BlockingFlags:
    - RETURNED_TO_AMARA
    RequiredMemoryId: 
    RequiredMemoryState: 
    Consequences: []
    Choices:
    - Text: Eight. The last one was scraped out.
      NextDialogueId: AMARA_RETURN_2
      RequiredFlags: []
      BlockingFlags: []
      Consequences: []
    - Text: Eight. And I think I knew the name.
      NextDialogueId: AMARA_RETURN_2
      RequiredFlags: []
      BlockingFlags: []
      Consequences:
      - Type: 5
        Target: AMARA
        Amount: 1
    NextDialogueId: 
    Subtitle: 
    VoiceAssetId: 
  - DialogueId: AMARA_RETURN_2
    Speaker: Queen Amara
    Text: Then we have both dreamed it. Ishan, I want you to listen carefully, because I am about to say something I will not be able to repeat, and I do not know why I am so certain of that -
    RequiredFlags: []
    BlockingFlags: []
    RequiredMemoryId: 
    RequiredMemoryState: 
    Consequences:
    - Type: 3
      Target: RETURN_AMARA
      Amount: 0
    - Type: 0
      Target: AVARSHA_SLEEP_BEGINS
      Amount: 0
    Choices: []
    NextDialogueId: 
    Subtitle: 
    VoiceAssetId: 
  - DialogueId: AMARA_AFTER
    Speaker: Queen Amara
    Text: ...
